{"id":"gewu_nscht","lemma":"gewünscht","pos":"adj","rank":2520,"glosses":["desired, wanted","requested"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈvʏnʃt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/De-gew%C3%BCnscht.ogg/De-gew%C3%BCnscht.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du dir etwas gewünscht?","en":"Have you made a wish?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Habt ihr euch etwas gewünscht?","en":"Have you made a wish?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe mir eine Schwester gewünscht.","en":"I wanted a sister.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sister"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie sich etwas gewünscht?","en":"Have you made a wish?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"something"},null]},{"text":"Ich hatte keine Zeit um zu suchen, was Ihr gewünscht habt.","en":"I haven't had time to look for what you wanted.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to search, to look for"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]}]}